stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> RUNNING: start, send EXECUTE step 1
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: DONE, send next step
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: timeout with attempts left, resend
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: DONE on step 4
    RUNNING --> REJECTED: step 1 rejected, nothing applied
    RUNNING --> COMPENSATING: later step rejected, or retries exhausted
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATING: DONE, undo next lower applied step
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATING: timeout, resend without limit
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATED: last applied step undone
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    COMPENSATED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
